      "defect": "ill-formed",
      "evidence": "The proof says the listed homotopies are “all bimodule-linear of cochain degree zero” and then refers to “each of the four homotopies,” though it lists only $fg\\simeq\\mathrm{id}_G$ and $gf\\simeq\\mathrm{id}_F$. The in-scope Statement specifies homotopies of cochain degree $-1$; the cited dependency `def-chain-homotopy` defines a homotopy as maps $s_n:C_n\\to D_{n+1}$, which have cochain degree $-1$ after reindexing. The inverse-on-cohomology argument uses the two standard degree-$-1$ homotopies, so this is a correctable proof-text error.",
